<title>LATVIA: HANSA INVEST WARNED BY SECURITIES COMMISSION.</title>
<headline>HANSA INVEST WARNED BY SECURITIES COMMISSION.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Investments has been warned by the securities commission after it advertised services it was not allowed to perform, the commission said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Hansa Investments, which does not have a licence to act as a financial intermediary, was warned on April 10 after it advertised services that can only be performed by a licensed brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
